  m_Name: C_P_Ferrum
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CodexPageData
  Title: Ferrum
  Version: 1.0.0
  Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00ebeb2939df9454e9ed338f1c90c4bf, type: 3}
  TagLine: 10,001 hours
  ContentHeaders:
  - Activation Criteria
  - Ability
  - Lore Entry
  Content:
  - Have at least 7 Ferrum Programs active in memory. The effect will then stay active.
  - '**7 Programs:** Increase reload speed by 50% for 2 seconds after a kill.

    **10
    Programs:** Gain an additional 33% chance on reload after a kill to not consume
    ammo for 3 seconds.'
  - "I won't make you feel lesser by explaining what a gun is to you. Just know you
    are still lesser. \n\nThe short version is: we thought guns were nice to give
    you. So what if we made them stronger? Bullets hurt, sure. But magical bullets?
    Ones you cant avoid? Physical and pyschological damage. best of both world.\n\nSo
    yeah. Go do a crime or whatever. But your responsible for what you do with your
    gun.\n\nMy advice? Aim away from yourself\n"
